      "message": "Thanks for the pointers!\n\nSo instead of creating a trace timer, the metrics timers just implement a simple version of the same logging. (no tags, not sensitive to tracing) 🤔\n\nIt\u0027s good enough for my current need, but I am quite tempted to change that code smell.",
